---
import '../styles/testimonials.css'
---

<section class="testim">
    <h2>Voices of <span class="highlight-text">Healing</span>: Our Patient Success <span class="highlight-text">Stories</span></h2>
    <p>Their words reflect the compassionate care, renewed hope, and transformative results we strive to deliver every day.</p>

    <div class="slider-controls">
        <button class="arrow-btn" id="prevBtn" aria-label="Previous testimonials">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"></path>
            </svg>
        </button>
        <button class="arrow-btn" id="nextBtn" aria-label="Next testimonials">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M9 18l6-6-6-6"></path>
            </svg>
        </button>
    </div>

    <div class="slider-viewport" id="sliderViewport">
        <div class="slider-track" id="sliderTrack">

            <div class="slide">
                <div class="test1">
                    <span class="quote-mark">&ldquo;</span>
                    <p>When I started my holistic treatment journey, I felt overwhelmed. But the team at Holistic Cancer Treatment provided such personalized care and emotional support that it transformed my entire outlook.</p>
                    <h4>— Eleanor V.</h4>
                </div>
                <div class="test1">
                    <span class="quote-mark">&ldquo;</span>
                    <p>I was struggling with the side effects of my conventional treatments until I incorporated the holistic therapies here. The natural remedies and nutritional guidance didn't just alleviate my discomfort; they made me feel stronger and more resilient.</p>
                    <h4>— Marcus W.</h4>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="slide">
                <div class="test1">
                    <span class="quote-mark">&ldquo;</span>
                    <p>Coming to Tijuana for treatment was a big step, but it was absolutely worth it. The doctors here are incredibly knowledgeable about holistic care, focusing on every aspect of my well-being.</p>
                    <h4>— Sofia R.</h4>
                </div>
                <div class="test1">
                    <span class="quote-mark">&ldquo;</span>
                    <p>What impressed me most was the personalized attention and the genuine care from everyone at the clinic. They listened to my concerns and tailored everything to my specific needs.</p>
                    <h4>— James C.</h4>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="dots" id="dotsContainer"></div>
</section>

<script>
    import "../scripts/testimonials.js"
</script>